---
const email = "bourdeltheo@gmail.com";
const links = [
    { label: "GitHub ↗", sub: "Code", href: "https://github.com/TheoBourdel" },
    {
        label: "LinkedIn ↗",
        sub: "Réseau",
        href: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/th%C3%A9o-bourdel-3790a81a4/",
    },
    { label: "Près de Paris", sub: "GMT+1" },
];
---

<section
    id="contact"
    class="screen flex items-center justify-center text-center px-[18px] md:px-11 py-12 md:py-16"
>
    <div class="w-full max-w-[860px] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="reveal" style="--delay: 60ms">
            <span class="eyebrow"
                ><span class="dot"></span>Réponse sous 24 h</span
            >
        </div>

        <h2
            class="reveal mt-[30px] font-bold tracking-tightest leading-[1.02] text-[40px] md:text-[58px] xl:text-[76px]"
            style="--delay: 160ms"
        >
            On travaille ensemble<span class="text-accent">?</span>
        </h2>

        <p
            class="reveal mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-base md:text-[19px] leading-[1.65] text-text-secondary"
            style="--delay: 260ms"
        >
            Une idée, une opportunité, ou juste envie d'échanger ? Écris-moi —
            je réponds vite.
        </p>

        <a
            href={`mailto:${email}`}
            class="reveal mt-8 inline-block font-bold text-[17px] md:text-[22px] bg-accent text-bg
              px-[22px] md:px-[30px] py-3.5 md:py-4 break-words hover:text-bg transition-all duration-300
              hover:brightness-110"
            style="--delay: 360ms"
        >
            {email}
        </a>

        <div
            class="reveal w-full mt-9 md:mt-[52px] md:pt-6 md:border-t border-border
                flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:gap-0"
            style="--delay: 460ms"
        >
            {
                links.map((l) => (
                    <div class="flex-1 basis-[140px] flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5">
                        {l.href ? (
                            <a
                                href={l.href}
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener"
                                class="font-bold text-text-primary hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-300"
                            >
                                {l.label}
                            </a>
                        ) : (
                            <span class="font-bold text-text-primary">
                                {l.label}
                            </span>
                        )}
                        <p class="label">{l.sub}</p>
                    </div>
                ))
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
